    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight other players in a fast paced environment with gravity that behaves differently across various maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the weapon you like the most and dominate the lobby with your skills! Kick, grab and shoot other players in to their doom.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different maps, with a big variety in between, will allow you to express your ability against in unique ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of customization to the gameplay for every lobby will allow you to explore many experiences along with different game modes! FFA, TEAM DEATHMATCH, CAPTURE THE FLAG and more that will come. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out also player's made maps! With the map editor you can create with little effort great content to play with others.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight other players in a fast paced environment with gravity that behaves differently across various maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the weapon you like the most and dominate the lobby with your skills! Kick, grab and shoot other players in to their doom.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different maps, with a big variety in between, will allow you to express your ability against in unique ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of customization to the gameplay for every lobby will allow you to explore many experiences along with different game modes! FFA, TEAM DEATHMATCH, CAPTURE THE FLAG and more that will come. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out also player's made maps! With the map editor you can create with little effort great content to play with others.</p>",
